{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261025-cbb2b1", "type": "material"}, "note": "秘密は一人で保持できず、必ず共有者を生成するという点を、束の入口に置く。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-a54851", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MOTIF-20261025-7f2b04", "type": "motif"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261025-f3bd04", "type": "material"}, "note": "守秘が預かりではなく遭遇の事後処理であることを、秘密の倫理の起点に置く。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-ab3446", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MOTIF-20261025-7f2b04", "type": "motif"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261025-44e81b", "type": "material"}, "note": "守秘が徳ではなく制度の構造であることを、秘仏・黒塗りの束へ渡す。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-19ae3b", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MOTIF-20261025-7f2b04", "type": "motif"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-20261025-77f2d6", "type": "material"}, "note": "秘匿が権利ではなく慣行として残ることを、黒塗り・特定秘密の議論へ渡す。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-533c13", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MOTIF-20261025-7f2b04", "type": "motif"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-20261025-ef6812", "type": "material"}, "note": "秘匿が内容の除去ではなく輪郭の提供になることを、暗号と鍵の束へ渡す。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-0b9658", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MOTIF-20261025-7f2b04", "type": "motif"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-20261025-14deb4", "type": "material"}, "note": "秘密が性質ではなく期限つきの指定であることを、束の出口に置く。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-0058b0", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MOTIF-20261025-7f2b04", "type": "motif"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261025-d07e5f", "type": "material"}, "note": "隠す制度が必ず代理を立てることを、嘘と偽物の束へ渡す。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-301dee", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MOTIF-20261025-7f2b04", "type": "motif"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-20261025-233702", "type": "material"}, "note": "隠蔽と選択の区別を、暗号と鍵の束の前提として渡す。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-0133a5", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MOTIF-20261025-7f2b04", "type": "motif"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-20261025-28a834", "type": "material"}, "note": "隠すことが忘却の反対であることを、束全体の締めとして置く。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-a07ade", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MOTIF-20261025-7f2b04", "type": "motif"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261025-0a6789", "type": "material"}, "note": "嘘の判定に文の外の席が必要であることを、束全体の前提として置く。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-2484e3", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MOTIF-20261025-7f2b04", "type": "motif"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261025-6a1d22", "type": "material"}, "note": "嘘の定義が心と表示の対応にあることを、意図のない偽りの束へ渡す。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-cb7b7b", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MOTIF-20261025-7f2b04", "type": "motif"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261025-292fce", "type": "material"}, "note": "嘘が受け手の認知制度に依存することを、嘘の束の軸に置く。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-25d0ec", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MOTIF-20261025-7f2b04", "type": "motif"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261025-c015df", "type": "material"}, "note": "嘘の検出が内面ではなく台帳の照合になることを、束の軸に置く。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-ae7994", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MOTIF-20261025-7f2b04", "type": "motif"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261025-f303d5", "type": "material"}, "note": "嘘の問題が真偽ではなく供給速度にあることを、機械の偽りの束へ渡す。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-00c533", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MOTIF-20261025-7f2b04", "type": "motif"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261025-4026e3", "type": "material"}, "note": "語らないことが嘘ではないという区分を、嘘の束と機械の沈黙の束へ渡す。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-a7b935", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MOTIF-20261025-7f2b04", "type": "motif"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261025-1a19c1", "type": "material"}, "note": "嘘が支えとして機能することを、暴露と黒塗りの議論へ渡す。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-e86bdf", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MOTIF-20261025-7f2b04", "type": "motif"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261025-c09582", "type": "material"}, "note": "偽りが受け手の欲望によって完成することを、機械の偽りの束へ渡す。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-110a98", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MOTIF-20261025-7f2b04", "type": "motif"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261025-16e697", "type": "material"}, "note": "真偽が編集の単位で決まることを、贋作と来歴の束へ渡す。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-b06ff9", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MOTIF-20261025-7f2b04", "type": "motif"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261025-cb8a98", "type": "material"}, "note": "真偽が文体の不一致の数え上げであることを、古文書学と贋作の束へ渡す。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-987651", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MOTIF-20261025-7f2b04", "type": "motif"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261025-2af47a", "type": "material"}, "note": "真偽が層ごとの値の束であることを、贋作の諸例へ渡す。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-b26c81", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MOTIF-20261025-7f2b04", "type": "motif"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261025-23d431", "type": "material"}, "note": "偽作が作者の消滅によって作品に変わることを、機械の生成物の束へ渡す。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-5933c9", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MOTIF-20261025-7f2b04", "type": "motif"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261025-d02528", "type": "material"}, "note": "人間らしさが機械からの漏れとして検出されることを、暗号と機械の偽りの束へ渡す。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-a6e5d3", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MOTIF-20261025-7f2b04", "type": "motif"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-20261025-e031f1", "type": "material"}, "note": "訂正が追加ではなく再実行であることを、束の軸に置く。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-fdf099", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MOTIF-20261025-7f2b04", "type": "motif"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-20261025-fc2c6d", "type": "material"}, "note": "訂正と抹消を分けるものが公示であることを、束の軸に置く。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-3f5863", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MOTIF-20261025-7f2b04", "type": "motif"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-20261025-06ea8d", "type": "material"}, "note": "来歴が内容の外側にしか保存されないことを、暗号と透かしの束へ渡す。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-05ff8b", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MOTIF-20261025-7f2b04", "type": "motif"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-20261025-9099a5", "type": "material"}, "note": "来歴が物語として提出されることを、ソーカル事件へ渡す。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-c5598c", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MOTIF-20261025-7f2b04", "type": "motif"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-20261025-6ac30a", "type": "material"}, "note": "形式の模倣が審査を通ることを、機械の偽りの束の入口に置く。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-c73ad6", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MOTIF-20261025-7f2b04", "type": "motif"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-20261025-0b9965", "type": "material"}, "note": "秘密を一点に集約する設計を、公開された台帳の条件として置く。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-20540b", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MOTIF-20261025-7f2b04", "type": "motif"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-20261025-bfa8df", "type": "material"}, "note": "量が秘密を消すことを、ゼロ知識と機械の漏洩の束へ渡す。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-121fb5", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MOTIF-20261025-7f2b04", "type": "motif"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261025-5f6ac7", "type": "material"}, "note": "存在の秘匿と内容の秘匿の区別を、機械の透かしの束へ渡す。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-1e2806", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MOTIF-20261025-7f2b04", "type": "motif"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-20261025-a647be", "type": "material"}, "note": "物質の年代だけが残る状態を、来歴と機械の忘却の束へ渡す。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-867c06", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MOTIF-20261025-7f2b04", "type": "motif"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-20261025-72cd4f", "type": "material"}, "note": "存在の秘匿を、秘仏と黒塗りの議論へ返す。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-bbac0b", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MOTIF-20261025-7f2b04", "type": "motif"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-20261025-9b1431", "type": "material"}, "note": "共有が運搬ではなく再計算であることを、ゼロ知識証明へ渡す。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-8f5f2d", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MOTIF-20261025-7f2b04", "type": "motif"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-20261025-cec9e5", "type": "material"}, "note": "知ることと証明できることの分離を、機械の自己報告の束へ渡す。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-7e5ae0", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MOTIF-20261025-7f2b04", "type": "motif"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-20261025-f7eb5c", "type": "material"}, "note": "読むことが痕跡を残すことを、読み痕跡と機械の漏洩の束へ渡す。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-df18c0", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MOTIF-20261025-7f2b04", "type": "motif"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-20261025-e277c3", "type": "material"}, "note": "処理と理解の分離を、機械の偽りと開示の束へ渡す。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-acd3ae", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MOTIF-20261025-7f2b04", "type": "motif"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-20261025-3af09f", "type": "material"}, "note": "意図・自覚・訂正可能性の三軸を、束全体の分け基準として置く。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-8c6111", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MOTIF-20261025-7f2b04", "type": "motif"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-20261025-6f7773", "type": "material"}, "note": "命名が責任の席を指定することを、束の基準として置く。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-92bd39", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MOTIF-20261025-7f2b04", "type": "motif"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-20261025-85b9e5", "type": "material"}, "note": "内部と出力の差を、機械の自己報告の束へ渡す。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-9efe1a", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MOTIF-20261025-7f2b04", "type": "motif"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-20261025-20ff0a", "type": "material"}, "note": "責任が生成ではなく維持に生じることを、束の軸に置く。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-580ba4", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MOTIF-20261025-7f2b04", "type": "motif"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-20261025-ad9280", "type": "material"}, "note": "漏洩が意図を持たないことを、差分プライバシーとメンバーシップ攻撃へ渡す。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-ebce3f", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MOTIF-20261025-7f2b04", "type": "motif"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-20261025-1a1459", "type": "material"}, "note": "秘匿が影響の管理になることを、メンバーシップ攻撃へ渡す。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-a8ed6b", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MOTIF-20261025-7f2b04", "type": "motif"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-20261025-12eed1", "type": "material"}, "note": "漏洩の単位が一記録であることを、開示義務の議論へ渡す。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-f2d4b2", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MOTIF-20261025-7f2b04", "type": "motif"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-20261025-63843a", "type": "material"}, "note": "表示が意図から独立していることを、束の出口に置く。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-525a98", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MOTIF-20261025-7f2b04", "type": "motif"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-20261025-bb990b", "type": "material"}, "note": "複製されるのが関係の認証であることを、横断報告の出口に置く。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-0490f4", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MOTIF-20261025-7f2b04", "type": "motif"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-TRC-20261025-secret-nokey", "type": "material"}, "note": "地の文に秘密の語が無いことと、鍵が鍵穴と鍵盤にしか現れないことを、主題選択の根拠として置く。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-7cb345", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MOTIF-20261025-7f2b04", "type": "motif"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261025-cbb2b1", "type": "material"}, "note": "個人が選ぶ守秘と、制度が発生させる守秘。隠す主体の違いを対に置く。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-860409", "relation_type": "contrast", "right": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261025-44e81b", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261025-f3bd04", "type": "material"}, "note": "どちらも「預けられた」のではなく「立ち会った／聞いた」ことから守秘が生じる。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-e47523", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261025-44e81b", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-20261025-ef6812", "type": "material"}, "note": "消した長さだけを見せる公開と、選んで開くことを選ぶ公開。公開の二方向。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-4694b8", "relation_type": "contrast", "right": {"id": "MAT-20261025-233702", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-20261025-77f2d6", "type": "material"}, "note": "秘匿が権利として負けたあとに慣行として残ることと、指定という行為で生まれること。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-c1a148", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MAT-20261025-14deb4", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261025-d07e5f", "type": "material"}, "note": "代理を立てて隠す（前立本尊）と、痕跡を残して消す（黒塗り）。隠す二つの版面。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-c660a0", "relation_type": "contrast", "right": {"id": "MAT-20261025-ef6812", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-20261025-28a834", "type": "material"}, "note": "隠すことを注意力の持続として測り直し、共有者の生成という読みを実測の問題に変える。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-8dc779", "relation_type": "reframes", "right": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261025-cbb2b1", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261025-0a6789", "type": "material"}, "note": "判定の席が文の外にない偽りと、心と表示の対応で定義される偽り。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-90e763", "relation_type": "contrast", "right": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261025-6a1d22", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261025-6a1d22", "type": "material"}, "note": "話し手の意図に置かれる嘘と、受け手の認知に置かれる嘘。嘘の所在の両端。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-583530", "relation_type": "contrast", "right": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261025-292fce", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261025-c015df", "type": "material"}, "note": "嘘の検出を記憶の照合に置く読みと、省略と順序に置く読み。どちらも内面を見ない。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-241d03", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261025-16e697", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261025-4026e3", "type": "material"}, "note": "語らない自由の確保と、語らないことで支えられる生活。沈黙の二つの評価。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-f57679", "relation_type": "contrast", "right": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261025-1a19c1", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261025-f303d5", "type": "material"}, "note": "嘘の供給速度と、受け手の欲望が偽りを完成させること。流通の両側面。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-90a563", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261025-c09582", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261025-cb8a98", "type": "material"}, "note": "文体の時代差による判定と、層ごとの物質の判定。来歴を見る二つの方法。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-06bc37", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261025-2af47a", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261025-23d431", "type": "material"}, "note": "作者の消滅で作品になる偽物と、内部の人間が露出する偽の機械。偽の露出の方向が逆。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-dccf60", "relation_type": "contrast", "right": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261025-d02528", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-20261025-e031f1", "type": "material"}, "note": "訂正が追加ではなく再実行であること（フッ素年代・紙の繊維）。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-96a13c", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MAT-20261025-06ea8d", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-20261025-fc2c6d", "type": "material"}, "note": "貼り替えによる抹消と、発見の状況ごと偽造された来歴。消すことと足すことの両極。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-31d36c", "relation_type": "contrast", "right": {"id": "MAT-20261025-9099a5", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-20261025-6ac30a", "type": "material"}, "note": "形式だけのものが審査を通ること（もっともらしい語彙／規則的な動作）。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-419e8c", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261025-d02528", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-20261025-0b9965", "type": "material"}, "note": "秘密を鍵の一点へ集約する設計と、量が鍵を一つに定めるという帰結。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-956689", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MAT-20261025-bfa8df", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261025-5f6ac7", "type": "material"}, "note": "在るのに見えないものを作る技術と、在るが読めないまま残った文書。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-383c8f", "relation_type": "contrast", "right": {"id": "MAT-20261025-a647be", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-20261025-72cd4f", "type": "material"}, "note": "存在そのものを三十年間隠した装置と、存在を公開したまま中身を隠した書。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-dc92ac", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261025-5f6ac7", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-20261025-9b1431", "type": "material"}, "note": "運ばずに共有される秘密と、渡さずに納得される証明。伝達しないことの二つの形。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-aa112f", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MAT-20261025-cec9e5", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-20261025-f7eb5c", "type": "material"}, "note": "読むことが痕跡を残す系と、読まずに処理する系。読むという行為の両端。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-106a51", "relation_type": "contrast", "right": {"id": "MAT-20261025-e277c3", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-20261025-3af09f", "type": "material"}, "note": "意図も自覚も無い偽りと、真実への無関心による偽り。三軸のうち別の軸が欠ける。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-3a44b9", "relation_type": "contrast", "right": {"id": "MAT-20261025-6f7773", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-20261025-6f7773", "type": "material"}, "note": "出力が態度を持たないという記述と、内部状態に真偽の差が現れるという測定。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-3e2ad5", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MAT-20261025-85b9e5", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-20261025-20ff0a", "type": "material"}, "note": "訂正の機会に維持したことが責任を生むのに対し、混入は誰の行為でもない。行為と環境の対照。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-779235", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MAT-20261025-ad9280", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-20261025-1a1459", "type": "material"}, "note": "参加の影響を小さくする保証と、在籍を当てる攻撃。同じ感度を守る側と問う側から見る。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-bddde8", "relation_type": "contrast", "right": {"id": "MAT-20261025-12eed1", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-20261025-63843a", "type": "material"}, "note": "名乗りを義務にする規則と、声を信じるなという助言。認証の制度が外へ出た二例。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-87b117", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MAT-20261025-bb990b", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261025-cbb2b1", "type": "material"}, "note": "ジンメルの「秘密は第二の世界を作る」を、共有者の生成という形で継ぐ。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-248055", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MAT-LIT-485", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261025-d07e5f", "type": "material"}, "note": "デリダの秘密の経験を、代理を立てて隠す制度の側から読み直す。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-37991d", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MAT-LIT-486", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-20261025-6f7773", "type": "material"}, "note": "フランクファートのでたらめを、AI の出力記述へ適用して組み替える。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-07dcf7", "relation_type": "reframes", "right": {"id": "MAT-LIT-327", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261025-5f6ac7", "type": "material"}, "note": "ピープスの暗号速記と並べ、読めるが読ませない形式の系譜に置く。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-d5b62d", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MAT-LIT-158", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-20261025-9b1431", "type": "material"}, "note": "鍵配送の解決を、公開鍵暗号の実装の前史として結ぶ。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-01c431", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MAT-20261024-24cdc7", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-20261025-63843a", "type": "material"}, "note": "来歴のシール（C2PA）を、表示義務の技術的な対応物として結ぶ。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-f3b378", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MAT-20261024-ce368a", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-20261025-12eed1", "type": "material"}, "note": "在籍を問う攻撃と、内容を取り出す攻撃。漏れる単位の違い。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-f020b0", "relation_type": "contrast", "right": {"id": "MAT-20261024-f191ca", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-20261025-e277c3", "type": "material"}, "note": "開けずに処理する設計と、印をつけて出自を示す設計。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-3e0930", "relation_type": "contrast", "right": {"id": "MAT-20261024-c9076a", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-20261025-3af09f", "type": "material"}, "note": "意味エントロピーによる幻覚検出を、三軸のうちの自覚の軸から読み直す。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-dc1496", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MAT-EVD-20261023-f3c8", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-20261025-85b9e5", "type": "material"}, "note": "訓練をすり抜ける整合性と、内部状態に現れる真偽の差を並べる。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-580bd0", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MAT-EVD-20261022-a1b2", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261025-23d431", "type": "material"}, "note": "『オシアン』と同じ時代の偽作現象を、作者の消滅という観点で結ぶ。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-2cfb8e", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MAT-20261024-02b80a", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-20261025-06ea8d", "type": "material"}, "note": "物質の層が来歴を語る例として、パリンプセストと紙の繊維を並べる。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-4b2209", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MAT-LIT-345", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-20261025-9099a5", "type": "material"}, "note": "来歴が物語として提出される点で、ヒトラーの日記と同型に置く。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-d9ff35", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MAT-20261024-24e6d6", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-20261025-14deb4", "type": "material"}, "note": "秘伝と公開の選択（風姿花伝）を、指定と期限という制度の側から照らす。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-fbdc5c", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MAT-LIT-015", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261025-16e697", "type": "material"}, "note": "省略と順序による偽りを、七つの証言の並び方へ接続する。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-c59162", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-a87774", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261025-292fce", "type": "material"}, "note": "証拠なき確信を、受け手の認知に依存する嘘の例として結ぶ。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-e024c3", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-11b3eb", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261025-1a19c1", "type": "material"}, "note": "落語「芝浜」の嘘を、修復の道具から支えとしての嘘へ組み替える。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-74c2eb", "relation_type": "reframes", "right": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-400fcc", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MOTIF-20261025-7f2b04", "type": "motif"}, "note": "光と影・透明と不透明の棚へ、隠す制度と鍵という二つの欄を持ち込み、「見えないこと」を倫理から設計へ移す。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-3536fd", "relation_type": "reframes", "right": {"id": "MOTIF-20261024-c9d4e1", "type": "motif"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MOTIF-20261025-7f2b04", "type": "motif"}, "note": "訂正と抹消の棚に、貼り替えと差し替え頁という実例を置き、訂正が善意の手続きであるという前提を一度止める。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-48db73", "relation_type": "interrupts", "right": {"id": "MOTIF-016", "type": "motif"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MOTIF-20261025-7f2b04", "type": "motif"}, "note": "署名・筆跡・印章の棚が扱った来歴の申告を、表示義務と透かしの側からもう一度結ぶ。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-955ea9", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MOTIF-20261024-f19932", "type": "motif"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MOTIF-20261025-7f2b04", "type": "motif"}, "note": "歓待の棚が扱った招くことに対し、招かずに隠すことを置き、開くことが善であるという前提を対照にする。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-5db3db", "relation_type": "contrast", "right": {"id": "MOTIF-20261024-b4f3a1", "type": "motif"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "Q-20261025-8f41d0", "type": "question"}, "note": "新規資料から開いた問い。資料の記述を答えの証明には使わない。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-af376a", "relation_type": "responds_to", "right": {"id": "MAT-20261025-14deb4", "type": "material"}}
