{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "FRAG-20261025-3d9c17", "type": "fragment"}, "note": "秘密の欄を作れないことを、空の頁を棚へ差す情景として書く。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-b55c13", "relation_type": "responds_to", "right": {"id": "Q-20261025-8f41d0", "type": "question"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "FRAG-20261025-6a2f58", "type": "fragment"}, "note": "嘘・偽り・でたらめを分ける三軸を、覚え書きの形で書く。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-f8c86e", "relation_type": "responds_to", "right": {"id": "Q-20261025-2c7e19", "type": "question"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "FRAG-20261025-6a2f58", "type": "fragment"}, "note": "増やすことが隠すことの反対になるという逆説を、条項として残す。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-bd04a3", "relation_type": "responds_to", "right": {"id": "Q-20261025-9d41e7", "type": "question"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-20261025-0b9965", "type": "material"}, "note": "秘密を一点へ集約する設計が、鍵を置けない棚という情景を、設計の問題として問い直す。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-0dd973", "relation_type": "reframes", "right": {"id": "FRAG-20261025-3d9c17", "type": "fragment"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "Q-20261025-3ea7c8", "type": "question"}, "note": "名乗りを義務とする規則が、同じ実践を別の意味へ変えるかどうかを、覚え書きの第六条へ問い返す。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-d259a7", "relation_type": "reframes", "right": {"id": "FRAG-20261025-6a2f58", "type": "fragment"}}
